sequenceDiagram
    participant Browser
    participant ProxyIframe as ProxyIframe<br/>(React Component)
    participant BetterAuth as Better Auth<br/>(JWKS / Session)
    participant GoProxy as Go Proxy Server
    participant PostgreSQL as PostgreSQL<br/>(proxy_sessions)
    participant SPN as Databricks OAuth<br/>(SPN /oidc/v1/token)
    participant LakehouseApp as Databricks<br/>Lakehouse App

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over Browser,SPN: Phase 1 — Session Initialization (POST /start-session)

        Browser->>ProxyIframe: Mount component (toolId, orgId)
        ProxyIframe->>BetterAuth: authClient.token()
        BetterAuth-->>ProxyIframe: short-lived JWT (signed, ~5 min TTL)

        ProxyIframe->>GoProxy: POST /start-session<br/>{ jwt, toolId, orgId }<br/>credentials: "include"
        GoProxy->>GoProxy: Validate Origin == FRONTEND_URL<br/>(strict CORS — no wildcards)
        GoProxy->>BetterAuth: Fetch JWKS, verify JWT<br/>(signature, iss, aud, exp)
        BetterAuth-->>GoProxy: Claims: sub (userId), email

        GoProxy->>PostgreSQL: validateUserAccess(userId, email, toolId, orgId)<br/>— user not banned, org membership,<br/>tool exists, SPN credentials
        PostgreSQL-->>GoProxy: appURL, workspaceURL,<br/>spnClientId, spnClientSecret

        GoProxy->>SPN: POST {workspaceURL}/oidc/v1/token<br/>grant_type=client_credentials<br/>Basic auth: clientId:clientSecret
        SPN-->>GoProxy: accessToken (1h TTL), tokenExpiresAt

        GoProxy->>GoProxy: Generate 32-byte random sessionID<br/>Compute hash = SHA-256(sessionID)
        GoProxy->>PostgreSQL: INSERT proxy_sessions<br/>(id=hash, userId, toolId, appURL,<br/>accessToken, tokenExpiresAt, expiresAt=+1h)
        PostgreSQL-->>GoProxy: OK

        GoProxy-->>Browser: Set-Cookie: proxy_sid={sessionID}<br/>HttpOnly; SameSite=None; Secure; Path=/; MaxAge=3600
        GoProxy-->>ProxyIframe: 200 OK { ok: true }

        ProxyIframe->>Browser: Render iframe<br/>src={proxyBaseUrl}/app-proxy/{toolId}/
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over Browser,LakehouseApp: Phase 2 — Proxied App Requests (cookie auth)

        Browser->>GoProxy: GET /app-proxy/{toolId}/<br/>Cookie: proxy_sid={sessionID}
        GoProxy->>GoProxy: Extract proxy_sid cookie<br/>Compute SHA-256(cookie value)
        GoProxy->>PostgreSQL: SELECT * FROM proxy_sessions<br/>WHERE id = hash
        PostgreSQL-->>GoProxy: Session record<br/>(accessToken, appURL, toolID, expiresAt)
        GoProxy->>GoProxy: Validate: session not expired,<br/>toolID matches request path

        opt Token expires within 5 minutes
            GoProxy->>SPN: POST /oidc/v1/token (refresh)
            SPN-->>GoProxy: new accessToken
            GoProxy->>PostgreSQL: UPDATE proxy_sessions<br/>SET access_token, token_expires_at
        end

        GoProxy->>LakehouseApp: GET {appURL}/...<br/>Authorization: Bearer {accessToken}<br/>(X-Forwarded-* headers stripped)
        LakehouseApp-->>GoProxy: HTML / JS / CSS / API response
        GoProxy->>GoProxy: Inject security headers:<br/>CSP: frame-ancestors 'self' {frontendURL}<br/>X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
        GoProxy-->>Browser: Forwarded response

        Note over Browser,LakehouseApp: WebSocket connections follow the same cookie-auth pattern
    end
